# Keep repo-only files out of the release ZIP built by `git archive` in
# .github/workflows/release.yml. Users extract that ZIP and point Chrome at it,
# so it should contain the extension and nothing else.
#
# Deliberately no `text`/`eol` rules here: the icons are binary PNGs and Chrome
# refuses to load the extension if a filter ever mangles them.
/.github     export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
